nds a turn; the storage book keeps a pilot that is not connected for a moment (it had fallen from 336,568 to 131,954 units between 20:20 and 20:38 UTC; mended at 20:44 UTC, and a full pass over the fleet's stores takes about 35 minutes). (8) The turn jobs of the five Admirals run on their schedule again, on Suggi's word.
